    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery Auctioneers are proud to welcome you to this beautifully presented two-bedroom first-floor apartment, ideally positioned in Barr Taoide overlooking the landmark Bonham Quay development and immediately adjacent to Galway Docks. \r\n\r\nNumber 1 offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, with a private balcony off the living/dining area. The layout comprises an entrance hall, an open-plan living/dining room and kitchen, two double bedrooms (one en-suite), and a main bathroom.  \r\n\r\nFurther features include a secure designated car parking space, balcony, built-in wardrobes to both bedrooms and electric heating.\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular feature of this apartment. Barr Taoide enjoys a highly convenient city-centre position, immediately adjacent to Galway Docks, the impressive Bonham Quay development, and the recently completed Queen Street Place, as well as Eyre Square and the Eyre Square Shopping Centre. From here, all that the city centre has to offer is readily accessible, with an excellent choice of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars and cultural attractions close by, as well as public transport.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended for anyone seeking a city-centre property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall:\tWith laminate floor, hotpress\r\n\t\r\nLiving/Dining Room/Kitchen:\t22'0\" (6.71m) x 13'4\" (4.06m) Range of fitted wall & floor units, built-in oven & hob, stainless steel sink unit, fridge freezer, dishwasher, washing machine, tiled floor to kitchen area, laminate floor to living/dining area, door to balcony.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 1: 13'5\" (4.09m) x 9'10\" (3m) Max Laminate floor, built-in wardrobe\r\n\t\r\nEn-suite:\tShower, wc, whb, tiled floor & walls, \"Dimplex\" heater\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 2: 13'5\" (4.09m) x 8'4\" (2.54m) Laminate floor, built-in wardrobe\r\n\t\r\nBathroom: Bath with overhead shower, wc, whb, mirror, tiled floor & walls, \"Dimplex\" heater\r\n\r\nPlease Note:\r\nMessrs. Mullery Auctioneers Ltd. for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that:- (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of Messrs. Mullery Auctioneers Ltd. has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property. (iv) We have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. (v) All measurements are approximate and photographs and maps provided are for guidance only. (vi) Where a Virtual Tour is provided, we do not accept any responsibility for the accuracy of the virtual tour measurement tool. Interested parties must confirm these measurements themselves by inspection or otherwise. (vii) Where a floorplan is provided please note the following; Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of these floorplans, any measurements, position of doors, windows etc are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission or mis-statement. These plans are provided for illustrative purposes only and should be used as such. These plans are for guidance only and must not be relied upon as a statement of fact. Attention is drawn to this important notice."
